  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Telecommunication Infrastructure Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at developing the telecommunication
infrastructure in Turkmenistan through the interconnection of 9
cities to the telephone and data networks using an optical fibre
cable and by increasing the capacity of telephone digital
exchanges in capital Ashgabat.</narrative>
  </description>
